 * slightly different copy of that record into the world, and the record is
 * worth more than the convenience.
 *
 * The top-of-page "Last updated" date comes from git's last commit to this file
 * rather than from the newest entry here, so a change that only moves markup
 * still moves the date. See the doc comment at the top of the frontmatter.
 */
